# Edge cases derived by hand from SPEC.md (A-rule noted per block).
### strict-limits-deadband-direct A2-A4
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 30
s 2 10
s 3 30.5
s 4 28
s 5 27.9
s 6 9
s 7 12
s 8 12.1
s 9 40
s 10 5
s 11 50
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@3:30.500
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@5:27.900
LOW TO_LOW@6:9.000
LOW
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@8:12.100
HIGH TO_HIGH@9:40.000
LOW TO_LOW@10:5.000
HIGH TO_HIGH@11:50.000
