### fault-and-recovery A6-A6a
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 5 nan
sf 6 20
s 7 40
sf 8 20
s 9 20
---
cfg
NORMAL
FAULT TO_FAULT@5:nan
FAULT
HIGH TO_NORMAL@7:40.000 TO_HIGH@7:40.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@8:20.000
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@9:20.000
### maintenance-catch-up-new-episode A10
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=100
init 0
s 10 40
maint 20 on
tick 200
s 210 20
s 220 5
maint 230 off
tick 329
tick 330
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@10:40.000
HIGH
HIGH
NORMAL
LOW
LOW TO_LOW@230:5.000
LOW
LOW ESCALATE@330:5.000
